WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE Narration of brag.mp4 / brag-720.mp4, transcribed locally with whisper.cpp (small.en) and checked against the on-screen text.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
Hold F9, just talk.

2
00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.000
The orb moves with your voice.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.600
Let go, and clean text lands
right where your cursor is.

4
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.300
Whisper runs on your Mac.

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.220
11 seconds of speech,
transcribed in under one.

6
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.460
Change your mind? “Scratch that.”

7
00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.340
Need it private? “Privacy on.”

8
00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:21.180
Halo. Your voice, typed.
Your audio stays home.
